                <cite class="fn color-main" itemprop="name"><a href="https://iyyz.org" rel="external nofollow">一叶竹</a></cite>
                    <span class="comment-ua">
    &nbsp;&nbsp;<i class="ua-icon icon-android"></i>&nbsp;&nbsp;Android&nbsp;/&nbsp;    <i class="ua-icon icon-chrome""></i>&nbsp;&nbsp;Google Chrome</span>
            </div>
            <div class="comment-reply">
                <a href="https://www.pslanys.com/archives/obsidian-setting.html?replyTo=197#respond-post-513" rel="nofollow" onclick="return TypechoComment.reply('comment-197', 197);">Reply</a>            </div>
            <div class="comment-meta">
                <a href="https://www.pslanys.com/archives/obsidian-setting.html#comment-197">
                    <time itemprop="commentTime"
                          datetime="2025-04-01T08:20:46+08:00">April 1, 2025</time>
                                            <span class="comment-location"></span>
                                    </a>
                            </div>
            <div class="comment-content" itemprop="commentText">
                                <p>最近也是尝试了很多笔记软件，最后在Logseq和Obsidan犹豫了好久还是选择了后者，主要还是Logseq的大纲式目录 用着有点不习惯。</p>            </div>
                            <div class="comment-children" itemprop="discusses">
